			<sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
			<sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
			<description><![CDATA[菜单栏图标现在可以关掉了：设置 → 通用 → 窗口 →「在菜单栏显示图标」。关掉之后快捷键照常用，再打开一次 Lumo 就会弹出设置，能把它调回来。]]></description>
			<enclosure url="https://github.com/max1874/lumo-releases/releases/download/v1.0.3/Lumo-1.0.3.zip" length="2765605" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="NT+C8Rf+lTQsgqfvvx/VhkGTx0dLtA0wRBfJtmShKcIz3jOG8ggz4Wz2rjnjCeY/mexElE83rjcsLwW7V88/Ag=="/>
